# pq-devnet-5 bootnodes (QUIC multiaddrs)
#
# Ready path for when an operator pq-devnet-5 mesh opens.
# One multiaddr per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# leanroadmap does not publish a permanent public list; paste the
# operator nodes.yaml / ENR-derived QUIC multiaddrs for the active run.
#
# Example (replace with real peers):
# /ip4/203.0.113.10/udp/9000/quic-v1/p2p/12D3KooWExamplePeerIdReplaceMe
#
# Also accepted via:
#   ethean start --network pq-devnet-5 --bootnodes '<addr1>,<addr2>'
#   ETHEAN_BOOTNODES='<addr1>,<addr2>'
#
# Until those multiaddrs exist, prefer the default:
#   ethean start --network pq-devnet-4
